{"unit_id":"f03d27fc59ab3bf87b6a","title":"提案一: 有關糖尿病用藥 TZD, DPP4i, SGLT2i 三者互相轉換情形","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b18","raw_text":"提案一: 有關糖尿病用藥 TZD, DPP4i, SGLT2i 三者互相轉換情形 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,555.2460327148438,507.4200134277344,571.2059936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b19","raw_text":"說明: 符合這三類藥物的給付規定並檢附起始治療的相關病歷與檢驗報告,  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[35.400001525878906,585.2460327148438,571.3800048828125,601.2059936523438]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b20","raw_text":"經具體詳實記載新的臨床狀況,有轉換的必要時，TZD, DPP4i, SLGT2i  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":43,"bbox":[83.42400360107422,615.2760620117188,575.3399658203125,631.2360229492188]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b21","raw_text":"三者得互相轉換。例如:因水腫將 TZD 轉成 DPP4i；或有CHF,將\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,645.2760620117188,537.7200317382812,661.2360229492188]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b22","raw_text":"DPP4i(或TZD) 轉成 SGLT2i...等等。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":29,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,675.2760620117188,361.69000244140625,691.2360229492188]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b23","raw_text":"決議:照案通過，如說明段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[36.0,705.2760620117188,244.0699920654297,721.2360229492188]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-07fad65d2a17d3780867-p2-b24","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,735.2720336914062,43.97999954223633,751.2319946289062]}],"source_quality":[]}